  "title": "TPG AG Real Estate Acquires $628M Industrial Portfolio in Partnership with Redfearn Capital",
  "summary": "The transaction comprised a 5.4 million-square-foot industrial portfolio across seven states New York – August 6, 2026 – TPG, a leading global alternative asset management firm, today announced that its TPG AG U.S. Real Estate platform (“TPG AG”) has acquired a 53-building industrial portfolio (the “Portfolio”) for $628 million. The transaction was sourced and led […]",
